    "wikipedia_summary": "<i><b>Aichryson villosum</b></i> is a species of herbaceous flowering plants in the family Crassulaceae. The species occurs in the Azores and Madeira archipelagoes. The species was first described by Sabin Berthelot and Philip Barker-Webb in 1840, published in <i>Natural History of the Canary Islands</i>.",
